          <p class="parag">Bank Mellat Turkey Branches are licenced to take deposits from its domestic and international customers. In line with the said licence and regular implementation, our customers may open time and demand deposit accounts with us, regardless of their nature either in the name of real entities or corporate bodies. By their origins deposit accounts can be maintained in 4 groups as per the identity of their holders.
 </p>        
<p class="parag">
 <ul>
